{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"746939355003748354","content":"Reading though y'all's brief discussion about damage resistances and immunities and here are my thoughts in case y'all have heard them yet. Flavor-wise, I think Web fit s3 perfectly. I'm really proud of their arc from anti-hero to suffering ally to someone who brought people together. Mechanically though, Web would have made a much better villain with the undead and damage types and such. I'm still proud that those resistances became a meme.","created_at":"2020-08-23T14:19:43.387000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"747097747408027689","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
